o featured memes and cartoons singing a catchy tune with lyrics begging for better reviews like “I know guys, you were not expecting such a productive holiday” and “Please don’t give me any more one-star ratings. I was chosen for this job and there is not much I can do about it.” The video has been viewed nearly\n######################\nOutput:', 'role': 'user'}, {'role': 'assistant', 'content': '("entity"<|>DINGTALK<|>ORGANIZATION<|>DingTalk is a Chinese app that received over 15,000 one-star reviews and 2,000 five-star ratings)\n##\n("entity"<|>DINGTALK CEO<|>PERSON<|>DingTalk\'s CEO admitted that he would probably have done the same thing as a child)\n##\n("entity"<|>APP ANNIE<|>ORGANIZATION<|>App Annie is a mobile data and analytics company)\n##\n("entity"<|>TECHNODE<|>ORGANIZATION<|>TechNode is a news outlet that reported on DingTalk\'s rating)\n##\n("entity"<|>BILEBILI<|>ORGANIZATION<|>Bilibili is a Chinese streaming site where DingTalk uploaded an apology video)\n##\n("entity"<|>CHINA<|>GEO<|>Country where DingTalk\'s app rating dropped to close to one star)\n##\n("entity"<|>FEBRUARY 2020<|>EVENT<|>Month when DingTalk\'s rating dropped and the company went back up to a 2.6 star rating)\n##\n("relationship"<|>DINGTALK<|>APP ANNIE<|>DingTalk received over 15,000 one-star reviews from App Annie\'s data<|>9)\n##\n("relationship"<|>DINGTALK<|>TECHNODE<|>TechNode reported on DingTalk\'s rating and the student backlash<|>8)\n##\n("relationship"<|>DINGTALK<|>BILEBILI<|>DingTalk uploaded an apology video on Bilibili to appease their anger<|>9)\n##\n("relationship"<|>DINGTALK CEO<|>DINGTALK<|>DingTalk\'s CEO admitted that he would probably have done the same thing as a child<|>8)\n##\n("relationship"<|>DINGTALK<|>CHINA<|>DingTalk\'s app rating dropped to close to one star in China<|>9)\n##\n("relationship"<|>FEBRUARY 2020<|>DINGTALK<|>DingTalk\'s rating dropped and the company went back up to a 2.6 star rating in February 2020<|>9)\n<|COMPLETE|>'}], 'name': 'extract-co